0,ABVD: Kodi,https://abvd.eva.mpg.de/austronesian/language.php?id=318,(Kodi Balagar): maníhu. 5? 4? 5? 1? 6? dial. 1? 6? 2? 1? when? where? 18? 1? what? who? how? 2x4; dial. (Kodi Bhokolo): pandapuoto. Seen an error? Please let us know:,Kodi,Austronesian
1,Kodi language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/kodi_language,"Kodi is an Austronesian language of the Malayo-Polynesian branch, spoken primarily in the southwestern region of Sumba Island in Nusa Tenggara Timur Province, eastern Indonesia.",Kodi,Austronesian
2,Notes on Kodi Phonology - Research Repository,https://repository.essex.ac.uk/39796/,"This paper describes aspects of the phonology of Kodi, an Austronesian language of Sumba, Indonesia. Based on the analysis of recordings of an elicited word list, the description covers the segmental phonology, syllable structure, stress and the spreading of palatalization and labialization features.",Kodi,Austronesian
3,Notes on Kodi Phonology - soas-repository.worktribe.comNotes on Kodi Phonology - evols.library.manoa.hawaii.eduMusic addons | Category | Omega - KodiMusic library - Official Kodi Wiki,https://soas-repository.worktribe.com/output/365457/notes-on-kodi-phonology,"This paper describes aspects of the phonology of Kodi, an Austronesian language of Sumba, Indonesia. Based on the analysis of recordings of an elicited wor... Aug 29, 2022 · This paper describes aspects of the phonology of Kodi, an Austronesian language of Sumba, Indonesia. Based on the analysis of recordings of an elicited word list, the description covers the segmental phonology, syllable structure, stress and the spreading of palatalization and labialization features. Listen to Triple R: an independent community radio station in Melbourne, Australia. Play audio content from the German tv broadcaster ""WDR"". This add-on lists all videos of the WDR Rockpalast. Play concert content from the German tv broadcaster ""WDR3"". Jun 17, 2026 · Music library ... The Music section of Kodi consists of a powerful and feature rich library that allows the flexible sorting and organization of your music collection. What is the music section of Kodi? The Music section of Kodi consists of a powerful and feature rich library that allows the flexible sorting and organization of your music collection. The aim of these modules is to provide the required information to enable you to correctly set up, modify, and reinstate your Music library as required. What Kodi addon is available for Scoot media streamer? The official Kodi addon for Scoot Media Streamer. Switchback is a Kodi utility for fast switching between recently played media. Listen to Triple R: an independent community radio station in Melbourne, Australia. Play audio content from the German tv broadcaster ""WDR"". This add-on lists all videos of the WDR Rockpalast. Does Kodi have music videos? Kodi has the ability to include Music Videos in the Video and Music libraries. All scanned music videos will show up in both. Music Videos can also be part of Party Mode and Smart Playlists. Playlists containing both music and music videos should be stored in the mixed playlist subfolder under the userdata folder.",Kodi,Austronesian
